<deviceset name="WE-PMCI_252010" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14283811/8" prefix="L">
<description>WE-PMCI Power Molded Chip Inductor
Shielded

Characteristics
Very compact design
High efficiency due to low total losses
High rated current values, up to 9.05 And high saturation currents
Low RDC-values, starting at 21 mΩ
Magnetically shielded construction
Side termination for best soldering result
Operating temperature: –40 °C to +125 °C
Recommended soldering profile: Reflow

Applications
DC/DC converters especially at high switching frequencies &gt; 1 MHz
High current power supply, Battery powered devices
Powerable electronic devices with very low profile
Portable devices like Smart Phones, Tablets, Notebooks and Digital Cameras

Updated by Ella 2026-09-17
2026 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
